Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.31,0:00:13.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a close one! Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.69,0:00:14.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Salmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.69,0:00:16.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.48,0:00:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.69,0:00:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Convergence! Piercing Blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.91,0:00:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he wound it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.70,0:00:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he was holding back when he fought me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.75,0:00:33.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Those wounds'll heal quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.75,0:00:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Inumaki will stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.88,0:00:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll attack, and then we'll get away from\Nit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.51,0:00:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we'll repeat that as we try to get\Noutside this veil,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.88,0:00:45.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and rejoin the principal and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.30,0:00:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's no telling
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.56,0:00:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when this current balance will fall apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.35,0:00:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His cursed speech
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.56,0:00:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doesn't seem to be very effective,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.94,0:00:59.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we're not getting a chance to contact\Nthe teachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.32,0:01:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it figures out how to deal with his\Ncursed speech,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.90,0:01:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.32,0:01:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.95,0:01:10.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We still don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what this cursed spirit's after!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.79,0:01:14.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's possible the principal and the\Nsorcerers
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.75,0:01:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stationed at Jujutsu High haven't taken\Nany action yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.00,0:01:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to join up with Todo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.96,0:01:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or at the very least, Miwa, but
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.35,0:01:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Inumaki will stop it for you! Attack it\Nnow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.02,0:01:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.03,0:01:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the one hitting his limit first?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.38,0:02:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How're you doing, Kamo? Still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.01,0:02:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Inumaki wasn't even using powerful words,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.22,0:02:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it still destroyed his throat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.64,0:02:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This thing's just that much stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.61,0:02:23.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mustard leaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.19,0:02:27.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't, Inumaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.99,0:02:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's way too strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.25,0:02:41.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blast away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.02,0:03:02.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't hope to cut me with that dull\Nblade.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.08,0:03:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its eye trees are more fragile
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.70,0:03:18.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,than the rest of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.12,0:03:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, that sword isn't so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.05,0:03:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have something even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.05,0:03:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I have to say, using this one feels\Ndisgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.52,0:03:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,"Cursed tools" are weapons imbued with\Ncurses.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.69,0:03:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Based on their force and their effects,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.90,0:03:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're divided into grades one through\Nfour,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.48,0:03:49.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just like sorcerers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.53,0:03:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The higher a cursed tool's grade,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.70,0:03:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the greater the advantage it provides its\Nuser
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.11,0:03:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in jujutsu combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.08,0:03:59.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Megumi, you'd better not lose that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.29,0:04:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.12,0:04:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's probably worth five billion if you\Nsold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.92,0:04:06.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.13,0:04:08.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Special-grade cursed tool: Playful Cloud!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.10,0:04:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed, that is a good weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.98,0:04:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Demon Dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.11,0:04:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the exception of my expanded\Ntechnique,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.20,0:04:34.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bottomless Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.95,0:04:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if any of my ten shikigami are completely\Ndestroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.20,0:04:41.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can never manifest them again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.17,0:04:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.33,0:04:48.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all of the power and techniques
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.17,0:04:50.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of each of the destroyed shikigami,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.97,0:04:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are passed on to the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.18,0:05:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Totality!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.81,0:05:08.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It learns fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.19,0:05:10.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's trying to take off my wounded arm\Nfirst.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.57,0:05:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sorcerer boy is in the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.20,0:05:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The boy's sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.83,0:05:26.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maki!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.80,0:05:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't ever let me use that three-piece\Nstaff again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.26,0:05:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.85,0:05:41.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, you get used to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.39,0:05:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Megumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.81,0:05:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maki!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.02,0:05:51.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it! All because I screwed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.23,0:05:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My strike was aimed for your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.45,0:05:57.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a wonderful reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.87,0:06:03.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jujutsu sorcerers are so extraordinarily\Ncompassionate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.04,0:06:06.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a result, an opening is always created
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.83,0:06:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when their ally is injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.84,0:06:14.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.25,0:06:17.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Megumi released the technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.43,0:06:21.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't use cursed techniques\Nanymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.05,0:06:24.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bud embedded in you now, loves cursed\Nenergy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.89,0:06:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the more you use techniques,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.89,0:06:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the deeper its roots will extend into your\Nbody.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.06,0:06:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What good's the warning?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.86,0:06:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're just gonna kill us anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.07,0:06:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, it works faster when I explain\Nit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.24,0:06:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You move well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.67,0:06:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, you're missing the edge you had\Nearlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.68,0:07:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to wring out that cursed energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.89,0:07:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if it rips my stomach open!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.27,0:07:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not like everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.10,0:07:10.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I choose who I protect!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.94,0:07:14.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shoulder the least responsibility!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.48,0:07:16.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Therefore,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.15,0:07:20.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am simply not allowed
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.49,0:07:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to fall before anyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.91,0:07:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Megumi, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.37,0:07:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.17,0:07:37.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did it! Our job here is done!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.13,0:07:39.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to tag out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.39,0:07:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.56,0:07:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, friend. You good to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.57,0:08:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.50,0:09:40.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.05,0:09:45.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe these two got beaten this\Nbadly!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.51,0:09:47.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Todo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.05,0:09:48.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.47,0:09:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your strength is the one thing you've got\Ngoing for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.31,0:09:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget it, Itadori!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.44,0:10:02.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may think you can handle that thing,\Nbut
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.65,0:10:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.28,0:10:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.91,0:10:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take these two and get them out of the\Nveil.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.49,0:10:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to the report from Nishimiya,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.12,0:10:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is an anti-Gojo veil.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.50,0:10:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the rest of us can come and go without\Nany issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.46,0:10:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait! Not even you can't- - Fushiguro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.50,0:10:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.55,0:10:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.67,0:10:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.93,0:10:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you've realized it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.10,0:10:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those who are growing wings
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.10,0:10:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are forever untouchable by the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.10,0:10:42.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's exactly where Itadori is\Nstanding now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.36,0:10:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You die again and I'll kill you myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.53,0:10:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on now, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.95,0:10:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pandash!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.32,0:10:54.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well alright then! I guess I'd better not\Ndie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.12,0:10:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to lift a finger to help\Nyou,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.12,0:10:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you know that, right, Itadori?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.54,0:11:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not until you land a Black Flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.50,0:11:05.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can't land a Black Flash,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.59,0:11:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I'll just watch you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.51,0:11:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens to you. Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.38,0:11:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.97,0:11:15.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, Sukuna's vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.39,0:11:16.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.39,0:11:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who is that man?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.14,0:11:20.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has a certain presence,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.39,0:11:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the amount of cursed energy he\Npossesses
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.94,0:11:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is most definitely less than mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.61,0:11:29.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, he has that mysterious\Nbrazenness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.61,0:11:31.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have quite the technique,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.57,0:11:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since I can't move freely before him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.58,0:11:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what is this "Black Flash,"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.20,0:11:39.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and how will they attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.96,0:11:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.58,0:11:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.38,0:11:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, there's something I want to\Nask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.18,0:11:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you connected with
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.80,0:11:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a humanoid cursed spirit with a patchwork\Nface?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.56,0:12:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if I say that I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.77,0:12:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't carelessly close the distance!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.19,0:12:08.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I commend him for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.40,0:12:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.61,0:12:15.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he has more explosive power than that\Ngirl, earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.62,0:12:18.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, its intensity is poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.58,0:12:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a wide open shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.58,0:12:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's letting its guard down because I held\Nback!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.04,0:12:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can land it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.21,0:12:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Black Flash!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.22,0:12:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.60,0:12:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.64,0:12:46.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anger is a trigger for sorcerers,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.69,0:12:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it can work for you both ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.65,0:12:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A sorcerer can be taken down in a fight
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.69,0:12:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,simply because he accidentally enraged his\Nfoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.86,0:12:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the opposite is also true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.24,0:13:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes they lose because their own\Nanger
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.29,0:13:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,disrupts their cursed energy
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.66,0:13:04.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to the point they can't exercise their\Nabilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.62,0:13:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your friend has gotten hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.67,0:13:07.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what's even worse than that,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.88,0:13:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they've rained on your honeymoon with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.84,0:13:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your new best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.50,0:13:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So take it from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.88,0:13:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can absolutely understand why you're\Nboiling with rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.09,0:13:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But all that rage is too much for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.31,0:13:21.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, put it away for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.48,0:13:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they fighting each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.86,0:13:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So how do you feel? You clear-headed now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.49,0:13:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no stray thoughts left!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.91,0:13:40.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for that, my new best friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.33,0:13:45.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Black Flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.33,0:13:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a distortion of space,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.29,0:13:49.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,born from the impact of cursed energy
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.34,0:13:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,delivered within a trillionth of a second\Nof a blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.76,0:13:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It delivers two point five times
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.72,0:13:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the force of a normal strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.72,0:14:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no sorcerers who can\Nconsistently use Black Flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.93,0:14:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.10,0:14:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,between those who have experienced Black\NFlash
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.69,0:14:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and those who have not,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.77,0:14:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their distance from the core of cursed\Nenergy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.36,0:14:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is like the distance of Heaven from Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.70,0:14:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What tremendous concentration!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.58,0:14:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The instant cursed energy makes impact
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.58,0:14:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,within that trillionth of a second of a\Nblow,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.71,0:14:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,space is distorted,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.13,0:14:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and cursed energy flashes black!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.80,0:14:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Black Flash!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.94,0:14:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.79,0:15:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.80,0:15:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Black Flash? So I did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.43,0:15:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.64,0:15:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my cursed energy I'm sensing,\Nisn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.81,0:15:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you understand the taste of cursed\Nenergy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.19,0:15:30.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.61,0:15:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up until now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.77,0:15:37.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you've just been taking an ingredient
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.61,0:15:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that you've never tasted before,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.78,0:15:40.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and throwing it into a pot and boiling it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.99,0:15:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,without understanding why.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.24,0:15:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now, after experiencing Black Flash,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.24,0:15:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you understand the taste of your\Ningredient,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.62,0:15:51.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.25,0:15:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stand on a completely different level\Nas a chef
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.21,0:15:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,than you did just three seconds ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.00,0:15:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So congratulations, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.63,0:16:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you can become truly strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.68,0:16:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had been told that Sukuna's vessel
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.85,0:16:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was immature as a sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.89,0:16:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he and this mysterious man,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.06,0:16:15.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something about them is different from the\Nother masses.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.90,0:16:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can heal?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.28,0:16:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A cursed spirit is made up of cursed\Nenergy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.90,0:16:23.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Therefore, unlike us,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.49,0:16:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they don't need advanced reversed cursed\Ntechniques
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.70,0:16:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to heal their bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.45,0:16:28.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An injury like that
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.91,0:16:31.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would mean very little to a special-grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.91,0:16:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's no doubt
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.04,0:16:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that it shaves away their cursed energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.83,0:16:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and if you crush their head, it's game set\Nand match.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.92,0:16:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.84,0:16:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say you and I get cooking?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.26,0:16:45.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would seem
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.30,0:16:49.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that perhaps
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.52,0:16:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should take you two somewhat seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.87,0:17:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ungh! That's a wide-ranging attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.29,0:17:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't falter!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.54,0:17:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wide range attacks have less speed and\Nforce.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.34,0:17:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That hit hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.97,0:17:30.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their blows aren't as bad as that flashy\Nblack one before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.89,0:17:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But each one possesses enough force that,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.14,0:17:36.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if they continue steadily, they'll damage\Nme!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.90,0:17:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Todo! Let's coordinate our timing better!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.90,0:17:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.57,0:17:43.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.11,0:17:44.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our footing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.94,0:17:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I messed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.57,0:17:48.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought it was passing cursed energy\Nthrough real objects
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.95,0:17:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in order to manipulate that much mass!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.78,0:17:53.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's all the embodiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.33,0:17:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The manifestation of its cursed energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.54,0:17:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a special-grade for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.17,0:17:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Learn how great the land is!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.34,0:18:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attacking while we fall? That's brutal!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.96,0:18:05.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.13,0:18:06.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.97,0:18:11.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They dodged that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.01,0:18:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.35,0:18:15.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This strange feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.40,0:18:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, Hanami,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.82,0:18:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you should really be more honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.95,0:18:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe I'm faking anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.99,0:18:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't mean to call you a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.20,0:18:36.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know why you're fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.00,0:18:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.04,0:18:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should enjoy the battles, the present,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.84,0:18:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much more than you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.80,0:18:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you enjoy them, Mahito?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.97,0:18:49.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.43,0:18:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.80,0:18:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it was only recently that the joy and\Npleasure
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.01,0:18:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel in battle became my main\Nmotivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.60,0:18:59.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before I knew it,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.23,0:19:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I began tricking, deceiving, and\Nmurdering.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.06,0:19:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then suddenly I felt fulfilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.23,0:19:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think just as humans eat, sleep and\Nscrew,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.03,0:19:10.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things are a curse's instincts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.03,0:19:15.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As cursed spirits, we may have gained the\Npower of reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.83,0:19:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that still doesn't justify going\Nagainst our instincts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.00,0:19:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For everyone, the soul is a blend of\Ninstinct and reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.67,0:19:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So as a result,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.01,0:19:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no one can say anything about an\Nindividual's ratio.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.22,0:19:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But your soul is a little constrained,\Nisn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.10,0:19:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, Hanami,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.06,0:19:40.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in actuality,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.85,0:19:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're much stronger, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.07,0:19:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Todo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.03,0:19:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.67,0:20:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just expended a ton of cursed energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.88,0:20:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now's our chance
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.09,0:20:12.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.09,0:20:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.27,0:20:24.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mahito!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.90,0:20:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.27,0:20:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm enjoying a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.90,0:20:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm enjoying a fight, Mahito!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.16,0:20:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you good to go, brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.08,0:20:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you bet! -That's excellent! Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.29,0:20:44.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it's time to unleash my technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.84,0:22:17.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Juju Stroll!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.59,0:22:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coat rack!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.01,0:22:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gonna make a great new coat rack,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.60,0:22:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it's gonna be so nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.22,0:22:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.22,0:22:25.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! -Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.39,0:22:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would Gojo end up looking like? If\Nyou do him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.61,0:22:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Definitely a standing rack.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.82,0:22:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd use his hip girdle,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.03,0:22:36.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with the sacral bone and the coccyx,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.65,0:22:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as the base for the stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.28,0:22:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, I'd rework his femurs
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.28,0:22:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and use them to stabilize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.62,0:22:46.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd use his spine's lumbar and thoracic\Nvertebrae
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.45,0:22:49.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all up to the third cervical vertebrae.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.42,0:22:51.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to give it height, hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.25,0:22:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ancient camphor wood would be good!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.25,0:22:56.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd use that to make replicas of the\Nvertebrae,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.21,0:22:58.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then alternate them with the bones
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.05,0:23:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to accentuate the height.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.64,0:23:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'd extend the spinous process
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.26,0:23:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and complete the transverse process,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.10,0:23:09.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,based on the overall balance, to create\Nthe hangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.90,0:23:15.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd do that by grafting on more ancient\Ncamphor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.32,0:23:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Depending on the coloring,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.44,0:23:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it might be nice to cover the skull with a\Ntanned hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.24,0:23:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice, right? So very nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.70,0:23:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this one could be my best coat rack\Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.66,0:23:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What junk!
